t, not secretive.<br>Bangla Meaning: স্বচ্ছ; অকপট; গোপন নয়।</p>\r\n<p>- সুতরাং, অপশন বিবেচনা করে দেখা যায় যে, the correct synonym of \"Surreptitious\" is Clandestine. <br><br>Source:<br>1. Cambridge Dictionary.<br>2. Merriam-Webster Dictionary.<br>3. Accessible Dictionary.</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}], "General Mathematics": [{"id": "11", "question": "১১) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}], "General Knowledge": [{"id": "16", "question": "১৬) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) ", "option1": "", "option2": "", "option3": "", "option4": "", "option5": "", "answer": "0", "exp": ""}]}, "exam_time": 600000, "pk": 15481, "is_omr": false,